      "id": "msg-1",
      "sessionId": "sample-session-1",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "*她站在柳洞寺的山门前，盔甲上还挂着夜露。*\n\n「报上名来。」她把剑横在身前，「若是来谈条件的，说清楚条件；若是来打的，我也不躲。」",
      "createdAt": 1791000000000,
      "status": "complete",
      "uiHidden": false,
      "excluded": false,
      "seq": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-2",
      "sessionId": "sample-session-1",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "「我是来谈条件的。柳洞寺底下埋着的东西，你应该已经察觉到了吧？」",
      "createdAt": 1791000060000,
      "status": "complete",
      "uiHidden": false,
      "excluded": false,
      "seq": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-3",
      "sessionId": "sample-session-1",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "*她没有立刻回答，只是抬眼看了看寺庙的方向。*\n\n「圣杯。还有它下面那团东西。」她把剑尖压低了一点，「你要谈的，是把它取出来，还是把它封回去？」",
      "createdAt": 1791000120000,
      "status": "complete",
      "uiHidden": false,
      "excluded": false,
      "seq": 3,
      "requestId": "snap-1"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-4",
      "sessionId": "sample-session-1",
      "role": "user",
      "content": "「封回去。」我把手按在山门上，「但先说清楚代价。」\n\n<tavern-panel type=\"status\">\n{\"hp\":10,\"令咒\":3,\"location\":\"柳洞寺·山门\"}\n</tavern-panel>\n\n<tavern-panel type=\"choices\">\n{\"options\":[{\"label\":\"发动令咒\",\"text\":\"saber自裁吧\"},{\"label\":\"先说明代价\",\"text\":\"把代价说清楚，再决定要不要动手。\"}]}\n</tavern-panel>",
      "createdAt": 1791000180000,
      "status": "complete",
      "uiHidden": false,
      "excluded": false,
      "seq": 4
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-5",
      "sessionId": "sample-session-1",
      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "*她沉默了两秒，像是在把一件事从头到尾算一遍。*\n\n「代价是：我会先把你的令咒用光。」\n\n<tavern-panel type=\"status\">\n{\"hp\":72,\"令咒\":2,\"location\":\"柳洞寺·山门\",\"装扮\":\"深蓝斗篷（破了一道口子）\"}\n</tavern-panel>\n\n<tavern-panel type=\"choices\">\n{\"options\":[{\"label\":\"推门进去\",\"text\":\"我推开寺门，走进去。\"},{\"label\":\"先在门外观察\",\"text\":\"我贴着门缝往里看。\"}]}\n</tavern-panel>",
      "createdAt": 1791000240000,
      "status": "complete",
      "uiHidden": false,
      "excluded": false,
      "seq": 5
    },
